\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.4}{\ignorespaces One example of each aerobic zone class, and the facility it comes from. Each example is a test image from the chronological split (Section~\ref {sec:exp_mixed}) that all four pretrained models classified correctly with the highest mean confidence, so that it is a clear case of its class.}}{20}{figure.caption.19}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.5}{\ignorespaces One example of each clarifier class, and the facility it comes from, chosen in the same way as in Figure~\ref {fig:aerobic_examples}. The area outside each tank is masked to black by the preparation script (Section~\ref {sec:pipeline}).}}{20}{figure.caption.20}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.6}{\ignorespaces A relabelled clarifier from Cape Flats, shown with some of its surroundings. The original label was ``Scum'', but the label was corrected to ``Empty'', since the tank appears to be drained, with its floor and the shadow of the bridge visible inside it.}}{24}{figure.caption.22}%
